{"sha": "9adbde530f57e707d7fe37927ef812e104c31d622956d26ed249faab1ae4d0ae", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:sound-waves} 章 --- 流体中的声波}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:sound-waves:1}", "$c = \\sqrt{\\gamma RT/M}$：\\qty{331}{m/s}、\\qty{343}{m/s}、\\qty{299}{m/s}；氦气中", "\\qty{1010}{m/s}；CO$_2$ 中 \\qty{268}{m/s}。声带以相同", "频率振动，但声道的共振（决定音色）与 $c$ 成正比，", "故升高为原来的约三倍：", "声音听起来音调很高。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:sound-waves:2}", "\\qty{60}{dB}: $I = \\qty{1e-6}{W/m^2}$, $p_m = \\sqrt{2ZI} = \\qty{29}{mPa}$, $v_m = p_m/Z =", "\\qty{7e-5}{m/s}$, $\\xi_m = v_m/\\omega = \\qty{22}{nm}$. \\qty{120}{dB}: \\qty{1}{W/m^2},", "\\qty{29}{Pa}，\\qty{7}{cm/s}，\\qty{22}{\\micro m}。两个声源：\\qty{63}{dB}；一百个声源：\\qty{80}{dB}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:sound-waves:3}", "$I = 1/4\\pi r^2$: \\qty{0.080}{W/m^2} (\\qty{109}{dB}), \\qty{89}{dB}, \\qty{69}{dB}; $I = 10^{-6}$", "$r = \\sqrt{1/4\\pi10^{-6}} = \\qty{280}{m}$ 处；\\qty{100}{dB} 在 \\qty{30}{m} 处需要 $4\\pi \\times", "900 \\times 10^{-2} = \\qty{110}{W}$ 的声功率。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:sound-waves:4}", "$4.5 \\times 340 = \\qty{1.5}{km}$; $340 \\times 1.5 = \\qty{510}{m}$; $1500 \\times 1.2 = \\qty{1.8}{km}$;", "$1540 \\times 65 \\times 10^{-6} = \\qty{10}{cm}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:sound-waves:5}", "(a) $500 \\times 340/300 = \\qty{567}{Hz}$；$500 \\times 340/380 = \\qty{447}{Hz}$。(b) $500 \\times", "380/340 = \\qty{559}{Hz}$；两者同时运动：$500 \\times 380/300 = \\qty{633}{Hz}$，", "与仅声源运动（速度 \\qty{80}{m/s}）时的 \\qty{654}{Hz}，或仅观察者运动时的 \\qty{618}{Hz} 相比：起决定作用的是空气，", "而不是相对速度。(c) 墙壁接收到 \\qty{567}{Hz}", "的声波，并静止地再发出；驱动者以 \\qty{40}{m/s} 的速度靠近，频率为 $567 \\times", "380/340 = \\qty{633}{Hz}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:sound-waves:6}", "$v_m = p_m/Z$: \\qty{2.4}{mm/s}, \\qty{0.67}{\\micro m/s}, \\qty{25}{nm/s}; $\\xi_m = v_m/\\omega$:", "\\qty{390}{nm}, \\qty{0.11}{nm}, \\qty{4}{pm}; $I = p_m^2/2Z$: \\qty{1.2e-3}{W/m^2} (\\qty{91}{dB}),", "\\qty{3.3e-7}{W/m^2}（\\qty{55}{dB}）、\\qty{1.3e-8}{W/m^2}（\\qty{41}{dB}）。刚性介质", "在给定压强下几乎不动，并传递很小的功率。", "\\qty{1}{Pa} 相当于 \\qty{120}{dB}（参考值为 \\qty{1}{\\micro Pa}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:sound-waves:7}", "(a) $\\sqrt{1.013 \\times 10^5/1.2} = \\qty{290}{m/s}$；$\\times\\sqrt{1.4}$：\\qty{343}{m/s}。(b)", "$\\gamma = c^2M/RT$：空气为 $1.40$，氩气为 $1.71$（在取整误差内为 $5/3$）：", "三个平动自由度（$\\gamma = 1 + 2/3$），", "而双原子气体为五个（$1 + 2/5$）。(c) $\\sqrt{D/f} = \\sqrt{2 \\times 10^{-8}} = \\qty{0.14}{mm}", "\\ll \\lambda = \\qty{34}{cm}$：波峰与波谷之间没有热量流动。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:sound-waves:8}", "(a) 两端开口：$p = p_m\\sin kx\\cos\\omega t$，$kL = n\\pi$；一端闭口、一端开口：", "$p = p_m\\cos kx\\cos\\omega t$（速度节、压强腹位于闭口端），", "$kL = (2n - 1)\\pi/2$。(b) $L = c/2f = \\qty{39}{cm}$；$c/4f = \\qty{19.5}{cm}$。", "(c) 全部谐音都会出现；仅奇次谐音（即单簧管特有的空洞声音）。", "(d) 每个开口端的修正量为 $0.6 \\times 2 = \\qty{1.2}{cm}$：$L_{\\text{有效}} = \\qty{41.4}{cm}$，$f =", "\\qty{414}{Hz}$，偏低 $6\\%$ --- 管长必须截短至 \\qty{36.6}{cm}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:sound-waves:9}", "$\\mathcal P = \\qty{400}{W}$，$I = \\mathcal P/2\\pi r^2$。(a) \\qty{6.4e-3}{W/m^2}，\\qty{98}{dB}，", "$p_m = \\qty{2.3}{Pa}$。(b) $r = \\sqrt{400/2\\pi} = \\qty{8}{m}$；\\qty{2.5}{km} 处为 \\qty{70}{dB}。", "(c) $98 - 20\\log(r/100) - (r - 100)/100 = 70$：$r \\approx \\qty{950}{m}$。(d)", "$\\pi(10)^2/\\pi(0.95)^2 \\approx 110$ 个警笛。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:sound-waves:10}", "(a) $\\rho_0\\partial_tv = p_mk\\sin kx\\cos\\omega t$：$v = (p_m/Z)\\sin kx\\sin\\omega t$。(b)", "$e_k = \\tfrac12\\chi_Sp_m^2\\sin^2kx\\sin^2\\omega t$, $e_p = \\tfrac12\\chi_Sp_m^2\\cos^2kx\\cos^2\\omega t$:", "一者取极大时另一者恰好为零，无论在时间上还是空间上。(c) $E =", "S\\int_0^L(e_k + e_p)\\dd x = \\tfrac14\\chi_Sp_m^2SL$，为常量。(d) $I = pv =", "(p_m^2/4Z)\\sin2kx\\sin2\\omega t$：平均值为零，但每个周期内能量两次", "从压强腹流向速度腹，再流回。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:sound-waves:11}", "(a) 在 $t = 0$ 时发出的波前，其半径为 $ct$，此时声源距离为 $vt$：", "切锥满足 $\\sin\\theta = c/v$。(b) $\\theta = \\qty{39}{\\degree}$；锥面", "到达飞机正下方地面时，声源又前进了 $h/\\tan\\theta = \\qty{15}{km}$，", "即正上方经过之后 $15000/480 = \\qty{31}{s}$。(c) 沿整条航线、", "宽 \\qty{60}{km} 的带状区域都能听到轰鸣声。(d) $\\sin\\theta", "= 340/800$，$\\theta = \\qty{25}{\\degree}$；锥面处的爆裂声先到达，", "枪口的爆炸声以声速 $c$ 从枪口传出，稍后到达。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:sound-waves:12}", "(a) $f_1 = f(c + v\\cos\\theta)/c$。(b) $f_2 = f_1c/(c - v\\cos\\theta) = f(c + v\\cos\\theta)", "/(c - v\\cos\\theta) \\approx f(1 + 2v\\cos\\theta/c)$。(c) $2 \\times 5 \\times 10^6 \\times 0.5 \\times 0.5/1540", "= \\qty{1.6}{kHz}$；在 \\qty{90}{\\degree} 处为零：倾斜探头。(d) $\\Delta v = 50 \\times 1540/", "(2 \\times 5 \\times 10^6 \\times 0.5) = \\qty{1.5}{cm/s}$。耳朵实时跟随音调与音色：", "平滑的哨声表示层流，嘶嘶声则表示", "狭窄之后出现湍流。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:sound-waves:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $c = \\sqrt{1.4 \\times 8.31 \\times 288/0.029} = \\qty{340}{m/s}$；", "在 \\qty{30}{\\degreeCelsius} 时为 \\qty{349}{m/s}。\\qty{1}{km} 所需时间为 \\qty{2.9}{s}。", "", "\\textbf{2.} \\qty{1.4}{km}。通道长达数公里；它各部分发出的声音", "要经过数秒才能到达，并伴有来自云层", "和地面的回声。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $I = \\qty{1}{W/m^2}$：$p_m = \\sqrt{2ZI} = \\qty{29}{Pa}$，$v_m = \\qty{7}{cm/s}$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $It = \\qty{2}{J/m^2}$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $c$ 随高度增大；$\\sin i/c$ 为常量，$i$ 随之增大，于是", "声线向水平方向弯曲再向下折返：声音被限制在近地面", "处传播，因而能传得很远。水面上方最低层的空气被水冷却，", "情况相同。", ""]}